<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - May 02.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - May 02.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 percent protein to Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire and Northamptonshire May 113.50 Jun 114.50</p>
<p>Southampton Jul 106.50</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk May 95.50 Oct/Dec 101.50</p>
<p>Liverpool May 98.00</p>
<p>West Devon Jul 101.50</p>
<p>East Devon Jun 97.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk May 93.00</p>
<p>South Lincolnshire May 92.50</p>
<p>Humberside May 94.00</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire May 93.00/93.25/93.50</p>
</text>
